  values ('ME', 'long_answer', 'a) Father Cacella wrote: "He was the King and at the same time the Chief Lama", combining religious and secular powers in his hands. Describe Zhabdrung Ngawang Namgyel as an architect of the political system of Bhutan, with special reference to his dual system of administration, which endured until the establishment of the Hereditary Monarchy in 1907. (10 marks)', 'a) Zhabdrung Ngawang Namgyel arrived in Bhutan from Tibet in 1616. When the Portuguese Jesuit Father Cacella met him in 1627, he described him as both king and chief lama. Zhabdrung unified the valleys of western and central Bhutan, defended them against Tibetan invasions and created a state with its own identity. As architect of the political system he established the dual system of governance (Chhoe-sid nyi): religious affairs were headed by the Je Khenpo, the chief abbot of the monastic body, and civil and political affairs by the Druk Desi. Under the Desi were regional governors (Penlops of Paro, Trongsa and Daga) and district governors (Dzongpons). The dzongs he built served as centres of both religious and civil authority. He codified laws (the Tsa Yig) based on Buddhist principles. This system, with Zhabdrung as the supreme authority, endured - despite later instability - until the establishment of the hereditary monarchy in 1907, and its spirit continues in the Constitution (Article 2, Chhoe-sid nyi unified in the Druk Gyalpo).', null, '[{"point": "Zhabdrung arrived 1616; Cacella''s 1627 visit; unified country; dual system (Chhoe-sid nyi): Je Khenpo heads religious affairs, Desi heads civil administration; Penlops (Paro, Trongsa, Daga) and Dzongpons; dzongs as twin centres; laws (Tsa Yig); lasted until 1907", "marks": 10}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development') and t.slug = 'history-zhabdrung-and-the-zhung-dratshang'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-general-3'), 'standard', 10,
    1080, 'historical_official', 'awaiting_review',
    null, null,
    '{"verdict": "pass", "issues": [], "checker_notes": "Model answer, marking guide and rubric written by Claude from the RCSC paper; facts were checked against what is widely published, but please read before publishing. Real past-paper questions keep RCSC wording.", "batch": "ME Paper III (General): BCSE 2022, batch 2", "source": {"title": "BCSE 2022 Main Examination, General category, Paper III", "year": 2022, "url": "https://rcsc.gov.bt/bcse-past-question-papers/"}}'::jsonb, 'me-general-3-2022b2-a2', 1, null, null, null, null)
  returning id
)
