with nq as (
  insert into public.questions (stage, question_type, stem, model_answer, explanation, key_points, subject_id, topic_id, paper_id, difficulty, marks,
                                estimated_seconds, origin, status, parent_question_id, variation_type, ai_review, passage_group, passage_position, verified_by, subject_group_id, specialisation_id, image_url)
  values ('ME', 'long_answer', 'b) On 11 May 2022, the Zhung Dratshang (Central Monastic Body) commemorated 400 years of its establishment. The establishment of the Zhung Dratshang is of historic significance as it marked the first steps in unifying Bhutan as a nation state. Discuss the role of the Zhung Dratshang in nation building, especially in uplifting the spiritual and socio-cultural life of the Bhutanese people. (10 marks)', 'b) Zhabdrung founded the Zhung Dratshang (first at Cheri in 1620, later based at Punakha Dzong), the central monastic body headed by the Je Khenpo. Its role in nation building: it provided a common spiritual foundation and identity that united people of different valleys; it performs rituals and prayers for the peace and prosperity of the nation and the King; it preserves and teaches Buddhist philosophy, scriptures, languages, arts (painting, sculpture, mask dances) and traditions through monastic schools and shedras; it organises tshechus and religious festivals that bring communities together; it guides people in ethical values such as compassion and ley jumdrey; it participates in national ceremonies and has supported the nation in crises; and today it also runs social programmes such as counselling, care for the elderly and youth guidance.', null, '[{"point": "Founded by Zhabdrung (1620 at Cheri, later Punakha); role: spiritual guidance, rituals and prayers for the nation, monastic education and preservation of Buddhist scriptures/ arts, tshechus and festivals, unifying identity and values, support in national events (coronation, crises), social services and counselling; Je Khenpo as spiritual head", "marks": 10}]'::jsonb, (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development'),
    (select t.id from public.topics t where t.subject_id = (select id from public.subjects where slug = 'bhutan-institutions-development') and t.slug = 'history-zhabdrung-and-the-zhung-dratshang'), (select id from public.exam_papers where code = 'me-general-3'), 'standard', 10,
    1080, 'historical_official', 'awaiting_review',
    null, null,
    '{"verdict": "pass", "issues": [], "checker_notes": "Model answer, marking guide and rubric written by Claude from the RCSC paper; facts were checked against what is widely published, but please read before publishing. Real past-paper questions keep RCSC wording.", "batch": "ME Paper III (General): BCSE 2022, batch 2", "source": {"title": "BCSE 2022 Main Examination, General category, Paper III", "year": 2022, "url": "https://rcsc.gov.bt/bcse-past-question-papers/"}}'::jsonb, 'me-general-3-2022b2-a2', 2, null, null, null, null)
